WEBVTT
 
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
We've seen the crazy clips and clutch plays on Skirmish,
and we love the competitive energy.
 
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:14.000
So, we're trying something new and upping the stakes.
Introducing Skirmish Ascension.
 
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:23.000
This is our new limited-time version of the mode. Now, with a curated agent pool
with select abilities and an experimental rank leaderboard coming soon
at the start of Act 3 in patch
 
00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:32.000
12.08, we want to see how you measure up in a higher-stakes mode
that stays true to VALORANT's core identity.
This time around, we're bringing you both 1v1 and 2v2 queues.
 
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:39.000
The limited roster includes agents like Jett, Waylay, Chamber, Phoenix,
and several others, each with one ability
 
00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:47.000
from their kit. So, it's not just your aim,
it's also about your decision-making. Get ready to throw some flashes.
 
00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Weapons are staged by round phases: pistol rounds with Bandit and Sheriff,
then Bulldog and Guardian, and for the
 
00:00:55.000 --> 00:01:03.000
majority of the match, Vandal and Phantom.
 
00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:10.000
The rank ladder lives on the For the Win site, where you can track your progress,
see your rank, and see where you stack up. And you can earn rewards by
 
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:18.000
connecting your account and playing. You can head over to the site for more details.
Your response to Skirmish has been awesome. So, we wanted to try something new
and get this out to you as soon as possible.
 
00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:25.000
So, hop in and let us know how you feel.
 
